{% comment %}
  Inherited palette -> --suf-legacy-* tokens, for sections/suf-header.liquid.

  The forked header is inherited markup and keeps the inherited colours until
  it is rebuilt. These bind to the OLD pickers (Theme settings > Appearance),
  the same ones dt-custom.css.liquid reads, so the fork and the ~30 legacy
  templates cannot drift apart while pages are cut over one at a time.

  This is NOT the design system. The new palette lives in suf-tokens.liquid,
  where navy is primary and red is an accent; here red is primary, because that
  is what this markup was built for.

  Every value has a `default:` matching what the site renders today. A blank
  setting would otherwise emit `--suf-legacy-x: ;`, and an undefined var() is
  invalid at computed-value time -- it unsets the property rather than falling
  back to anything.

  DO NOT delete these settings from config/settings_schema.json while legacy
  templates still render: it would also empty dt-custom.css.liquid's matching
  --DT* property and visually break every legacy page.

  This whole snippet is deleted when the header is rebuilt.
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :root {
    --suf-legacy-primary: {{ settings.primary_color | default: '#c1121f' }};
    --suf-legacy-secondary: {{ settings.secondary_color | default: '#282828' }};
    --suf-legacy-heading: {{ settings.heading_color | default: '#c1121f' }};
    --suf-legacy-body-bg: {{ settings.body_bg_color | default: '#ffffff' }};
    --suf-legacy-border: {{ settings.border_color | default: '#e9e9e9' }};
    --suf-legacy-overlay: {{ settings.overlay_color | default: '#f7f3f2' | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.5 }};

    --suf-legacy-button-bg: {{ settings.button_bg_color | default: '#000000' }};
    --suf-legacy-button-text: {{ settings.button_text_color | default: '#ffffff' }};
    --suf-legacy-button-bg-hover: {{ settings.button_bg_hover_color | default: '#d8000c' }};
    --suf-legacy-button-text-hover: {{ settings.button_text_hover_color | default: '#ffffff' }};

    --suf-legacy-shadow: {{ settings.shadow_color | default: '#bbbbbb' }};
    --suf-legacy-shadow-light: {{ settings.shadow_color_light | default: '#e9e9e9' }};

    --suf-legacy-radius: {{ settings.overall_border_radius | default: 5 }}px;
  }
</style>
